{"kind":"FETCH","data":{"headers":{},"body":"{\"id\":116124,\"title\":\"The Proof Is Out There\",\"tagline\":\"\",\"overview\":\"Each episode analyzes and passes verdicts on several seemingly impossible things “caught on film,” including giant beasts, UFOS, apocalyptic sounds, hairy humans, alleged mutants from the deep, conspiracies, and many other cases. Host and veteran journalist Tony Harris takes nothing for granted in a quest for answers, tracking down eyewitnesses, putting each photo or film through a battery of tests, calling out the hoaxes, and highlighting the most credible evidence in an attempt to better understand our world.\",\"posterPath\":\"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w780/6DGWhIbtNOrTKu1yrTHM88fb1qc.jpg\",\"backdropPath\":\"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/original/uFs7FHQlZbeTHAEaF8rfUb7OcNP.jpg\",\"youtubeBackdrop\":null,\"anilistBanner\":null,\"rating\":7.3,\"voteCount\":11,\"year\":2021,\"genres\":[\"Sci-Fi & Fantasy\",\"Documentary\"],\"status\":\"Returning Series\",\"type\":\"tv\",\"totalSeasons\":6,\"totalEpisodes\":120,\"createdBy\":[],\"networks\":[\"History\"],\"countries\":[{\"code\":\"US\",\"name\":\"United States of America\"}],\"lastAirDate\":\"2026-09-29\",\"cast\":[{\"id\":1790660,\"name\":\"Tony Harris\",\"character\":\"Self - Host\",\"photo\":\"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w780/o8o2tdvVfDwFf7kw9ADgCVGffjg.jpg\"},{\"id\":83299,\"name\":\"Michio Kaku\",\"character\":\"Self - Dr. Theoretical Physics Professor\",\"photo\":\"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w780/brVv7KevXyEraj4vhcNySAc8myb.jpg\"}],\"trailers\":[{\"key\":\"YzFqvHZ7xYM\",\"name\":\"The Proof is Out There - Trailer\",\"site\":\"YouTube\",\"type\":\"Trailer\"}],\"similar\":[{\"id\":107957,\"title\":\"History's Greatest Hoaxes\",\"poster\":\"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w780/p3pJIvwqVsZasH9CXYsQfwaapSn.jpg\",\"rating\":7,\"year\":2016,\"type\":\"tv\",\"_score\":0.22386363636363638,\"_genreOverlap\":1},{\"id\":64900,\"title\":\"Hangar 1: The UFO Files\",\"poster\":\"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w780/b7JYJGFK4aI50KxuuGphhRkIUw5.jpg\",\"rating\":7.3,\"year\":2015,\"type\":\"tv\",\"_score\":0.22045454545454546,\"_genreOverlap\":1},{\"id\":99032,\"title\":\"In Search of Aliens\",\"poster\":\"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w780/dlh4wthAJImpoOi4UNXq9KDF1M4.jpg\",\"rating\":6.2,\"year\":2014,\"type\":\"tv\",\"_score\":0.21985294117647058,\"_genreOverlap\":1},{\"id\":215660,\"title\":\"The Proof Is Out There: Bermuda Triangle Edition\",\"poster\":\"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w780/fqjQo3Tjlol4QFuhYbWStq3qVt4.jpg\",\"rating\":3.5,\"year\":2022,\"type\":\"tv\",\"_score\":0.2173913043478261,\"_genreOverlap\":1},{\"id\":65083,\"title\":\"UFOs Declassified\",\"poster\":\"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w780/2IGCbZkZqwFnO94WnTjNjFhG1rc.jpg\",\"rating\":7.1,\"year\":2015,\"type\":\"tv\",\"_score\":0.21704545454545454,\"_genreOverlap\":1},{\"id\":108353,\"title\":\"UFOs\",\"poster\":\"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w780/xvwpLNyKRElnlI4sUaKOBY6Z2d1.jpg\",\"rating\":7.3,\"year\":2021,\"type\":\"tv\",\"_score\":0.21442307692307694,\"_genreOverlap\":1},{\"id\":105177,\"title\":\"Unsolved Mysteries\",\"poster\":\"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w780/5Gn9hoJZUiJX5yb4datIcoq3Day.jpg\",\"rating\":7.7,\"year\":2020,\"type\":\"tv\",\"_score\":0.21216216216216216,\"_genreOverlap\":1},{\"id\":129677,\"title\":\"Top Secret UFO Projects Declassified\",\"poster\":\"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w780/eB5aBU9TVZ3Lk7G7Ppy6Ym0rtAd.jpg\",\"rating\":7.3,\"year\":2021,\"type\":\"tv\",\"_score\":0.21200000000000002,\"_genreOverlap\":1},{\"id\":10268,\"title\":\"Primeval\",\"poster\":\"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w780/pjRhnncEnTT8T5YsLbTb0A4msuQ.jpg\",\"rating\":7.5,\"year\":2007,\"type\":\"tv\",\"_score\":0.21071428571428572,\"_genreOverlap\":1},{\"id\":69218,\"title\":\"Haunted or Hoax\",\"poster\":null,\"rating\":5,\"year\":2016,\"type\":\"tv\",\"_score\":0.20947368421052634,\"_genreOverlap\":1},{\"id\":220444,\"title\":\"UFOs: Investigating the Unknown\",\"poster\":\"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w780/6hjjlePqkcdQkK4VEe7kb4LRFop.jpg\",\"rating\":7.1,\"year\":2023,\"type\":\"tv\",\"_score\":0.20821917808219179,\"_genreOverlap\":1},{\"id\":255689,\"title\":\"Alien Encounters: Fact or Fiction\",\"poster\":\"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w780/4xKU6bq3LHeP9vegscRmEq5A4FF.jpg\",\"rating\":5.5,\"year\":2024,\"type\":\"tv\",\"_score\":0.20722891566265061,\"_genreOverlap\":1}],\"seasonNumber\":3,\"seasonName\":\"Season 3\",\"seasonOverview\":\"\",\"seasonPoster\":\"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w780/vbne3YrdXJPHw8l84KXXPhFxMXU.jpg\",\"seasonAirDate\":\"2022-10-07\",\"episodes\":[{\"number\":1,\"name\":\"Modern Day Dinosaur Sighting, Mysterious Lights Above Norway and Girl Punches Down Tree\",\"overview\":\"Reports of a dinosaur living in the African Congo, strange lights above the Hessdalen Valley in Norway, a 12-year-old girl in Russia with superhuman strength, and proof of an alien structure on an asteroid.\",\"still\":null,\"rating\":0,\"voteCount\":0,\"airDate\":\"2022-10-07\",\"runtime\":41},{\"number\":2,\"name\":\"Rubber Duck UFO, Grim Reaper Ice Sculpture and I Killed Bigfoot\",\"overview\":\"Investigating leaked video of a UFO shaped like a rubber duck, a man in India able to dip his hands in boiling oil and feel no pain, the overnight appearance of the Grim Reaper sculpted in ice, and a man who claims to have killed Bigfoot.\",\"still\":null,\"rating\":0,\"voteCount\":0,\"airDate\":\"2022-10-14\",\"runtime\":42},{\"number\":3,\"name\":\"Aswang, Crashed on Mars, and Giant Wolves\",\"overview\":\"What's the truth behind the recent caught on camera sightings of a dreaded Filipino creature known as the Aswang. Is there really a big bad wolf stalking the woods of Saskatchewan? What really happened the night a UFO famously appeared over a hotel in Montreal? And is a saucer like object spotted on the surface of Mars really a UFO crash landing site? Tony Harris and his team of experts dive into these claims to find the truth.\",\"still\":null,\"rating\":0,\"voteCount\":0,\"airDate\":\"2022-10-21\",\"runtime\":42},{\"number\":4,\"name\":\"Bigfoot Photobombs Eagle's Nest, Mexican Blackbirds Dive To Their Death, and Human Faced Fish\",\"overview\":\"Did a trail camera in Michigan capture footage of the elusive sasquatch? What caused a large flock of blackbirds to plunge to their death in Mexico? Is a ghostly phantom that seemingly appears out of nowhere and literally walks through traffic confirmation of a Filipino ghost legend? And is a human faced fish in China the product of genetic modification? Tony and his team of experts examine the evidence to find the truth.\",\"still\":null,\"rating\":0,\"voteCount\":0,\"airDate\":\"2022-10-28\",\"runtime\":42},{\"number\":5,\"name\":\"Marble Mountain Bigfoot, Waldek Mine Whispers, and UFO Buzzes Jet\",\"overview\":\"Is footage captured by campers at a known Bigfoot hot spot in Northern California the latest evidence that Sasquatch really exists? Did a man in Australia hear the whispers of the dead in an old abandoned gold mine? A Russian Strong Man sticks his neck out on the line when he bends a steel rod with his trachea. And an alleged UFO buzzes a Jet airliner in the skies above Nevada. Tony Harris and his team of experts examine the clues and make a determination about the validity of what we're seeing.\",\"still\":null,\"rating\":0,\"voteCount\":0,\"airDate\":\"2022-11-04\",\"runtime\":42},{\"number\":6,\"name\":\"ISS UFO Swarm, Yale Lake Leaf Monster, and Rat King\",\"overview\":\"Host Tony Harris investigates alleged videos, photos and audio recordings of giant beasts, UFOs, alleged mutants from the deep, and other mysterious phenomenon.\",\"still\":null,\"rating\":0,\"voteCount\":0,\"airDate\":\"2022-11-18\",\"runtime\":42},{\"number\":7,\"name\":\"Witch's Broomstick, UFOs vs Volcanoes, and Oakville Blobs\",\"overview\":\"A petrified creature discovered in Russia is said to be the work of the mythical Baba Yaga; a possible genetic experiment gone wrong; a fire with a mind of its own.\",\"still\":null,\"rating\":0,\"voteCount\":0,\"airDate\":\"2023-01-06\",\"runtime\":42},{\"number\":8,\"name\":\"Hook Island Monster, Skydiver's Plane Stall, and Somalia Freighter Phantom\",\"overview\":\"Is a photo taken in 1965 evidence of the existence of a prehistoric sea monster? How did skydivers survive a death defying jump as their plane stalled out and nearly collided with them?\",\"still\":null,\"rating\":0,\"voteCount\":0,\"airDate\":\"2023-01-13\",\"runtime\":42},{\"number\":9,\"name\":\"Panama UFO Disc, Bloody Red Sea, and the Dyatlov Pass Incident\",\"overview\":\"A flying saucer-shaped object spotted near the Panama Canal; the sudden appearance of a bloody red sea in Egypt; a group of hikers brutally killed in the mountains of Russia.\",\"still\":null,\"rating\":5,\"voteCount\":1,\"airDate\":\"2023-01-20\",\"runtime\":42},{\"number\":10,\"name\":\"Crocodile Monster, Tiktok USO, and Ghost Dog Collar Removal\",\"overview\":\"Gustav, the legendary man-eating crocodile accused of killing hundreds may still be alive. Also, glowing lights spotted in the waters of Mexico may be the latest proof that Unidentified Submersible Objects are for real.\",\"still\":null,\"rating\":5,\"voteCount\":1,\"airDate\":\"2023-02-03\",\"runtime\":42},{\"number\":11,\"name\":\"Congressional UFOs, New Nessie and Zombie Fish\",\"overview\":\"Examining if a video recently presented to Congress by the U.S. Navy proves once and for all that UFOs really exist; examining if the latest alleged Loch Ness monster footage is the most compelling proof of the creature's existence in years.\",\"still\":null,\"rating\":5,\"voteCount\":1,\"airDate\":\"2023-06-09\",\"runtime\":42},{\"number\":12,\"name\":\"Monster in the Attic, Houston UFO and Utah Bigfoot\",\"overview\":\"A video showing a strange formation of flickering lights; a mysterious humanoid creature is caught on camera in an abandoned attic.\",\"still\":\"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w780/1bDF1Tm3wZRblBTAaSxO5aCmi1d.jpg\",\"rating\":5,\"voteCount\":1,\"airDate\":\"2023-06-16\",\"runtime\":42},{\"number\":13,\"name\":\"Chupacabra, Greatest UFO Photo Ever and Mars Sounds\",\"overview\":\"The truth behind a recent sighting of Chupacabra outside of an Amarillo Zoo; an aerial photograph taken over Costa Rica could be the greatest UFO picture ever taken; strange sounds recorded on Mars.\",\"still\":\"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w780/zlUVuTwn1S4QAISHX7B4ffUcYq4.jpg\",\"rating\":0,\"voteCount\":0,\"airDate\":\"2023-06-30\",\"runtime\":42},{\"number\":14,\"name\":\"Alien Pilots, Carolina Lights and Stone Cold Animals\",\"overview\":\"Did a man in Turkey capture footage of alien pilots in a UFO cockpit? What are the strange lights repeatedly spotted over Brown Mountain in North Carolina since before the Civil War? Did an Australian man stumble upon an alien corpse on the sidewalk? And who or what turned these animals to stone? Tony and his team of experts examine the evidence to find the truth.\",\"still\":\"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w780/mkYJ7MULvuBwianUevRD63lZG4h.jpg\",\"rating\":5,\"voteCount\":1,\"airDate\":\"2023-07-07\",\"runtime\":42},{\"number\":15,\"name\":\"Mystery Sea Beast, the Earth is Alive and Shapeshifting UFO\",\"overview\":\"What is the mysterious sea beast seen from the shore of a small seaside town in the UK? Are summoners able to commune with UFOs? Were a field of massive mysterious jars made by giants? And the ground seems to be breathing. Is the earth alive? Tony Harris and his team of experts examine the clues and make a determination about the validity of what we're seeing.\",\"still\":\"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w780/7CcASi0evois71Bi19in8vjdwYl.jpg\",\"rating\":5,\"voteCount\":1,\"airDate\":\"2023-07-14\",\"runtime\":42},{\"number\":16,\"name\":\"Hairy Serpents, South Pole Nazis and the Horrible Blob\",\"overview\":\"What is this serpent like creature caught on camera and why does it have green hair? Is the discovery of an ancient antenna found beneath the waters of Antarctica, proof that the Nazis once colonized the south pole? Are these large boulders in Death Valley able to move by themselves? And did a man find a gelatinous alien life form on his kitchen floor? Tony Harris and his team of experts dive into these claims to find the truth.\",\"still\":\"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w780/i7pBgkZGiewNwTQPFUyNgytk1t3.jpg\",\"rating\":5,\"voteCount\":1,\"airDate\":\"2023-07-21\",\"runtime\":42},{\"number\":17,\"name\":\"UFO Lead, Bigfoot Films, and Lost City in the Gulf of Mexico\",\"overview\":\"The latest video leak from the Department of Homeland Security; one of the world's most respected Bigfoot researchers; anachronistic works of art; a lost, sunken city off the coast of Louisiana.\",\"still\":null,\"rating\":5,\"voteCount\":1,\"airDate\":\"2023-08-04\",\"runtime\":42},{\"number\":18,\"name\":\"Marfa Lights, Devil Goat and Subway Survivor\",\"overview\":\"Are the famous glowing lights seen above Marfa, Texas a natural or supernatural phenomenon? What spirit possessed a goat to walk down a street like a human? Are mysterious stone carvings in Japan connected to a legendary close encounter? And how did a woman miraculously survive falling on to the subway track as an oncoming train passes by? Tony Harris and his team of experts examine the clues and make a determination about the validity of what we're seeing.\",\"still\":null,\"rating\":5,\"voteCount\":1,\"airDate\":\"2023-08-11\",\"runtime\":42},{\"number\":19,\"name\":\"Mutant Mermaid, UFOs vs. Nukes and Seamonster Chases a Boat\",\"overview\":\"Scientists study claims of a dead mermaid discovered and preserved in Japan; UFOs attracted to nuclear facilities; the glowing-eyed sea creature captured on video chasing a motorboat; a man who lived alone in the jungle.\",\"still\":null,\"rating\":5,\"voteCount\":1,\"airDate\":\"2023-08-18\",\"runtime\":42},{\"number\":20,\"name\":\"Alien Sabotage, Ghost Child and Hungry Hungry Sasquatch\",\"overview\":\"Is this home security video proof that UFOs are messing with our technology? Did a species of carnivorous marsupials thought to be long extinct just get caught on camera? Did a visitor at a historic cemetery in Savannah capture home video of a ghost child? And a metal detectorist claims to have recorded the sound a hungry Bigfoot in the Alaskan wilderness. Tony Harris and his team of experts dive into these claims to find the truth.\",\"still\":null,\"rating\":5,\"voteCount\":1,\"airDate\":\"2023-08-25\",\"runtime\":42}],\"firstAirDate\":\"2021-01-05\"}","status":200,"url":""},"revalidate":86400,"tags":[]}